    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 112780,
      "end_ms": 115700,
      "text": "啊呃这样去推的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 118140,
      "end_ms": 120020,
      "text": "里面的class strugg贯穿一切"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 122540,
      "end_ms": 124070,
      "text": "它不叫做阶级矛盾的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 124070,
      "end_ms": 127520,
      "text": "我们我们这个class要把它翻译成就是类"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 127520,
      "end_ms": 130729,
      "text": "或者互为翻译成本体论阶次的阶次啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 130729,
      "end_ms": 133500,
      "text": "本体论阶次的那个阶次"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 134140,
      "end_ms": 136990,
      "text": "本体论阶次所具有的矛盾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 136990,
      "end_ms": 138790,
      "text": "只要它是本体论阶次"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 138790,
      "end_ms": 140170,
      "text": "他一定是是陷入矛盾的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 140170,
      "end_ms": 142760,
      "text": "这个矛盾是原初的物质性的矛盾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 142760,
      "end_ms": 144950,
      "text": "Class strugclass contradiction"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 144950,
      "end_ms": 147160,
      "text": "本体论的阶次性的矛盾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 147160,
      "end_ms": 149680,
      "text": "它体现在人类社会当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 149680,
      "end_ms": 150640,
      "text": "就是阶级矛盾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 150640,
      "end_ms": 152170,
      "text": "体现在啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 152170,
      "end_ms": 154030,
      "text": "整个物质现实的这么一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 154030,
      "end_ms": 155680,
      "text": "辩证性的演化过程当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 155680,
      "end_ms": 158430,
      "text": "他就是本体论的阶次矛盾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 158430,
      "end_ms": 161640,
      "text": "它是贯穿一切的这个本体论的阶次"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 163779,
      "end_ms": 164999,
      "text": "你到了动物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 164999,
      "end_ms": 167699,
      "text": "到了人开始开始有精神现象的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 167699,
      "end_ms": 169439,
      "text": "还要纵纵向发展"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 169439,
      "end_ms": 172550,
      "text": "这一整个可以看成是一个横向发展的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 172550,
      "end_ms": 173600,
      "text": "一个历史脉络"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 173600,
      "end_ms": 176079,
      "text": "到了人人的内在心灵"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 176079,
      "end_ms": 178869,
      "text": "人的内在心灵开始产生意识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 178869,
      "end_ms": 181820,
      "text": "开始产生自我意识啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 181820,
      "end_ms": 184400,
      "text": "开始产生反思性的意识啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 184400,
      "end_ms": 187780,
      "text": "反思性的自我意识啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 189020,
      "end_ms": 191890,
      "text": "啊这个里面是这样的发展学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 191890,
      "end_ms": 194220,
      "text": "这个里面的发展学以及"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 196219,
      "end_ms": 199989,
      "text": "我们说从你的感性层面啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 199989,
      "end_ms": 201260,
      "text": "到伦理"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 202080,
      "end_ms": 204470,
      "text": "伦理道德啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 204470,
      "end_ms": 207700,
      "text": "再到一个宗教啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 207700,
      "end_ms": 209440,
      "text": "再到一个哲学层面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 211219,
      "end_ms": 213099,
      "text": "精神现象的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 213099,
      "end_ms": 218120,
      "text": "它的发展也是由这这个阶次矛盾推动的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 218120,
      "end_ms": 219860,
      "text": "也是由我们说阶级矛盾推动的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 219860,
      "end_ms": 223260,
      "text": "也是由阶次矛盾推动的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 223260,
      "end_ms": 223740,
      "text": "了解吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 223740,
      "end_ms": 228000,
      "text": "因此就是唯物主义的辩证法是贯穿于其中的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 228000,
      "end_ms": 230000,
      "text": "贯穿于其中的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 230700,
      "end_ms": 244940,
      "text": "不允许不允许去幻想一种原始的固定的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 244940,
      "end_ms": 246380,
      "text": "不允许去幻想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 246380,
      "end_ms": 248480,
      "text": "就把某个环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 248480,
      "end_ms": 250460,
      "text": "不允许把某个环节给它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 250460,
      "end_ms": 255420,
      "text": "幻想成是一种原始的固定的一种神秘的字"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 257879,
      "end_ms": 261379,
      "text": "不允许一旦进行这种幻想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 261379,
      "end_ms": 263940,
      "text": "就是在陷入资产阶级意识形态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 264300,
      "end_ms": 265740,
      "text": "一旦陷入"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 265740,
      "end_ms": 267600,
      "text": "一旦陷入这种幻想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 269220,
      "end_ms": 270360,
      "text": "这种幻想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 271940,
      "end_ms": 275460,
      "text": "啊实际上就是把单个环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 275760,
      "end_ms": 279420,
      "text": "把单个环节作为一个神秘的字"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 279420,
      "end_ms": 283140,
      "text": "这个神秘的字其实就是用来作为资本增值的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 283300,
      "end_ms": 286840,
      "text": "就是用来资本用来作为资本增值的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 288639,
      "end_ms": 290459,
      "text": "不允许作为理论家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 290459,
      "end_ms": 292469,
      "text": "不允许这样做呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 292469,
      "end_ms": 294600,
      "text": "在那个呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 296440,
      "end_ms": 301280,
      "text": "在我批判那个相亲婚恋的那"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 301280,
      "end_ms": 303380,
      "text": "那就回应信件的那个视频里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 303380,
      "end_ms": 303980,
      "text": "有个家伙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 303980,
      "end_ms": 305100,
      "text": "他就这样做的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 305539,
      "end_ms": 306919,
      "text": "把美啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 306919,
      "end_ms": 311810,
      "text": "它千方百计的要论证美是一个不是由啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 311810,
      "end_ms": 313439,
      "text": "阶级秩序"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 313439,
      "end_ms": 314459,
      "text": "阶级统治秩序"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 314459,
      "end_ms": 315959,
      "text": "阶级文化所塑造的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 315959,
      "end_ms": 318610,
      "text": "他说美是由动物的原始的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 318610,
      "end_ms": 321660,
      "text": "动物的原始的那种生殖啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 321660,
      "end_ms": 323970,
      "text": "生殖那种神秘的那种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 323970,
      "end_ms": 327210,
      "text": "反正就是这种东西有一种原始的美是天然的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 327210,
      "end_ms": 330130,
      "text": "天性的天性自然的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 330130,
      "end_ms": 331660,
      "text": "那么当他这样做的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 331660,
      "end_ms": 333010,
      "text": "他已经是叛徒了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 333010,
      "end_ms": 334720,
      "text": "当他当那个人这样做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 334720,
      "end_ms": 335620,
      "text": "他已经是叛徒了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 335620,
      "end_ms": 336310,
      "text": "为什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 336310,
      "end_ms": 340530,
      "text": "因为它把一个环节固定为将死的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 340530,
      "end_ms": 342450,
      "text": "然后试图用这一个环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 342450,
      "end_ms": 344610,
      "text": "这个神秘的一种美的这种质啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 344610,
      "end_ms": 347809,
      "text": "美的这种生命的原始生命力来解释一切"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 347809,
      "end_ms": 351180,
      "text": "他没有看到他所把握的这个美的这个环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 351580,
      "end_ms": 355480,
      "text": "我们依然是在一整个阶次矛盾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 355480,
      "end_ms": 356920,
      "text": "一整个这个体系当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 356920,
      "end_ms": 357880,
      "text": "该把握的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 357880,
      "end_ms": 360720,
      "text": "一定要在一整个这个体系当中再来把握"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 360720,
      "end_ms": 364780,
      "text": "并且这一整个体系如果我们是个辩证唯物主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 364780,
      "end_ms": 366310,
      "text": "我们是一个辩证唯物主义的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 366310,
      "end_ms": 368620,
      "text": "他的环节之间的关系相对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 368620,
      "end_ms": 370330,
      "text": "甚至可以说是比较平等的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 370330,
      "end_ms": 373330,
      "text": "我们并不最终像黑格尔主义那样呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 373330,
      "end_ms": 373880,
      "text": "是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 376400,
      "end_ms": 378160,
      "text": "绝对知识的自我遗忘"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 378160,
      "end_ms": 381130,
      "text": "然后变成有和无作为开端啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 381130,
      "end_ms": 382780,
      "text": "纯有纯无作为开端"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 382780,
      "end_ms": 384250,
      "text": "我们我们不像黑格尔那样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 384250,
      "end_ms": 384910,
      "text": "我们不像黑格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 384910,
      "end_ms": 388330,
      "text": "我们把黑格尔体系整个连起来啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 388330,
      "end_ms": 388900,
      "text": "连起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 388900,
      "end_ms": 390160,
      "text": "这里面的环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 390160,
      "end_ms": 395520,
      "text": "从它都是这种本体论阶次矛盾的体现而言"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 395520,
      "end_ms": 397230,
      "text": "这里面的环节都是平等的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 397850,
      "end_ms": 398630,
      "text": "都是平等的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 398630,
      "end_ms": 400070,
      "text": "也都是注定失败的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 400070,
      "end_ms": 403730,
      "text": "没有谁是没有谁是最核心的关键枢纽性的环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 403730,
      "end_ms": 404940,
      "text": "一旦他这样做的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 404940,
      "end_ms": 407580,
      "text": "它实际上是就要把这一个环节提出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 407580,
      "end_ms": 408740,
      "text": "当成一个资本"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 408740,
      "end_ms": 409940,
      "text": "当资本用"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 409940,
      "end_ms": 410900,
      "text": "当大写字母了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 410900,
      "end_ms": 413360,
      "text": "当开头大写字母来用啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 413360,
      "end_ms": 415510,
      "text": "我们在这里要强调一点呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 415510,
      "end_ms": 416800,
      "text": "就是那么很简单"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 416800,
      "end_ms": 418420,
      "text": "你可以把美还原成什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 418420,
      "end_ms": 420630,
      "text": "他说美是动物的哎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 420630,
      "end_ms": 423510,
      "text": "动物生殖活动当中就孔雀开屏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 423510,
      "end_ms": 425940,
      "text": "就有这种外部体表"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 425940,
      "end_ms": 429620,
      "text": "或者它羽毛毛发色彩的一个特异化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 429920,
      "end_ms": 432290,
      "text": "那那动物为什么具有生殖性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 432290,
      "end_ms": 434560,
      "text": "动物为什么是两性生殖系哎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 434560,
      "end_ms": 436660,
      "text": "为什么有的动物有两性生殖性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 436660,
      "end_ms": 438280,
      "text": "有的动物不是没有两性食性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 438280,
      "end_ms": 439240,
      "text": "两性生殖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 439240,
      "end_ms": 440260,
      "text": "生殖性本身"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 440260,
      "end_ms": 444040,
      "text": "从动物性当中是如何养洋气的动物的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 445860,
      "end_ms": 447260,
      "text": "是只是生存"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 447260,
      "end_ms": 448190,
      "text": "只是吃东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 448190,
      "end_ms": 450860,
      "text": "个体动物所谓生殖性阳气"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 450860,
      "end_ms": 453390,
      "text": "动物的个体性代表动物的群体性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 453390,
      "end_ms": 456030,
      "text": "但这群体性只是体现为生殖性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 456030,
      "end_ms": 460120,
      "text": "而且他一定要体现在不仅是群体的相共同性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 460120,
      "end_ms": 462460,
      "text": "还要体现在群体的差异性当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 462460,
      "end_ms": 464140,
      "text": "也就是性的差异性当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 464140,
      "end_ms": 465040,
      "text": "性别的差异性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 465040,
      "end_ms": 466420,
      "text": "它是个群体的差异性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 466420,
      "end_ms": 467380,
      "text": "它不是个体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 467380,
      "end_ms": 469420,
      "text": "它不仅仅是个体之间有性差异"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 469420,
      "end_ms": 472330,
      "text": "群体之间它是一个群体内在的一个差异性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 472330,
      "end_ms": 474900,
      "text": "群体本身所设立给个体的差异性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 474900,
      "end_ms": 477660,
      "text": "群体本身不仅仅把自己作为普普遍性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 477660,
      "end_ms": 479440,
      "text": "作为共性设立给动物群体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 479440,
      "end_ms": 482420,
      "text": "还把他自己作为差异性设设立给动物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 482479,
      "end_ms": 483199,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 483199,
      "end_ms": 485740,
      "text": "那在这个过程中美学美"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 485940,
      "end_ms": 488400,
      "text": "他如果说非要把美还原成这种东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 488400,
      "end_ms": 489420,
      "text": "然后说这个是不可还原"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 489420,
      "end_ms": 489720,
      "text": "我告诉你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 489720,
      "end_ms": 490980,
      "text": "这是很容易被还原的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 490980,
      "end_ms": 492729,
      "text": "因为一些动物是不具有的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 492729,
      "end_ms": 495969,
      "text": "怎么发展作植物很明显也不太具有植物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 495969,
      "end_ms": 500820,
      "text": "当然也有也已经有它的这个升值的两性化的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 501020,
      "end_ms": 502520,
      "text": "它有雄蕊雌蕊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 502520,
      "end_ms": 505680,
      "text": "但是植物不具有个体性唉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 505680,
      "end_ms": 509160,
      "text": "但是植物的那种外在的符号学表征"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 509160,
      "end_ms": 510990,
      "text": "植物的美学的特异化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 510990,
      "end_ms": 517010,
      "text": "它又完全又和动物的生殖是两码事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 517010,
      "end_ms": 518900,
      "text": "因为植物比较像那种很显眼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 518900,
      "end_ms": 520010,
      "text": "招蜂引蝶的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 520010,
      "end_ms": 521880,
      "text": "或者让你去吃它的果实"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 522179,
      "end_ms": 524760,
      "text": "他在这里并不是和动物产生交配"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 524760,
      "end_ms": 526710,
      "text": "和这个生命符号吸引来了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 526710,
      "end_ms": 527400,
      "text": "产生交配"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 527400,
      "end_ms": 529599,
      "text": "它是它是生殖的后续环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 529660,
      "end_ms": 533700,
      "text": "我们必须坚持辩证唯物主义的一点就在于"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 533700,
      "end_ms": 536760,
      "text": "我们并不认为你把这个美还原到一个什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 536760,
      "end_ms": 538800,
      "text": "自然天性当中就不还原了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 538800,
      "end_ms": 540120,
      "text": "我们要进一步还原"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 540120,
      "end_ms": 542280,
      "text": "我告诉你这个还原是无止境的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 542280,
      "end_ms": 544160,
      "text": "这一还原是无止境的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 544160,
      "end_ms": 547100,
      "text": "这个还原通过辩证法是会还原到诶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 547100,
      "end_ms": 549270,
      "text": "动物性还原到植物性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 549270,
      "end_ms": 550770,
      "text": "植物性在还原到"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 550770,
      "end_ms": 553579,
      "text": "我们说无机性无极性再还原到这里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 553579,
      "end_ms": 554959,
      "text": "一排排下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 554959,
      "end_ms": 556939,
      "text": "它是无限还原的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 556939,
      "end_ms": 558880,
      "text": "它是无限革命的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 559140,
      "end_ms": 562200,
      "text": "他是无限的进行阶级矛盾的分析的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 562200,
      "end_ms": 562980,
      "text": "阶层矛盾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 562980,
      "end_ms": 564240,
      "text": "阶次矛盾是本体论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 564240,
      "end_ms": 565450,
      "text": "阶次矛盾的分析"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 565450,
      "end_ms": 566770,
      "text": "不去进行这样的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 566770,
      "end_ms": 570480,
      "text": "而停留在每某一个这种什么自然的天生的原"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 570480,
      "end_ms": 573570,
      "text": "使得淳朴的本真的这么一个环节上面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 573570,
      "end_ms": 575319,
      "text": "这种做法是叛徒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 576020,
      "end_ms": 577360,
      "text": "这种做法是叛徒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 577360,
      "end_ms": 579850,
      "text": "这种做法是缺乏哲学修养的体现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 579850,
      "end_ms": 581860,
      "text": "这种做法是无知的体现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 581860,
      "end_ms": 583839,
      "text": "这种做法是愚蠢的体现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 585500,
      "end_ms": 586780,
      "text": "这种做法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 586780,
      "end_ms": 589000,
      "text": "这也在这样做的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 589000,
      "end_ms": 591000,
      "text": "你就背叛了哲学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 591120,
      "end_ms": 593880,
      "text": "当然也背叛了我们辩证唯物主义的立场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 593880,
      "end_ms": 594720,
      "text": "价值立场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 594720,
      "end_ms": 596460,
      "text": "因为你在这里就是停了下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 596460,
      "end_ms": 598020,
      "text": "那个审美符号的生产者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 598020,
      "end_ms": 599160,
      "text": "审美符号的拥有者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 599160,
      "end_ms": 602040,
      "text": "你去为他们的原始的天然的优势地位则做辩护"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 602040,
      "end_ms": 603010,
      "text": "你是个叛徒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 603010,
      "end_ms": 606060,
      "text": "你再给他们的原始的优势地位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 606060,
      "end_ms": 607920,
      "text": "审美上的高级地位在做辩护"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 607920,
      "end_ms": 609600,
      "text": "说这种美是天然的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 609600,
      "end_ms": 610380,
      "text": "是优越的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 610380,
      "end_ms": 611280,
      "text": "是本来就好了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 611280,
      "end_ms": 612470,
      "text": "原初生命力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 612470,
      "end_ms": 614510,
      "text": "这种做法是叛徒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 614510,
      "end_ms": 616490,
      "text": "他不仅在哲学上是背叛了思想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 616490,
      "end_ms": 617630,
      "text": "它的价值体系上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 617630,
      "end_ms": 621600,
      "text": "也是背叛了真正的现实力量的生产者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 621600,
      "end_ms": 626640,
      "text": "它它已经效忠于某一种个别的某个符号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 626640,
      "end_ms": 631240,
      "text": "某个将死的一个符号的拥有者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 631920,
      "end_ms": 635180,
      "text": "明明白吗啊这样的美学是肮脏的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 635180,
      "end_ms": 637140,
      "text": "是是是卑劣的美学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 638240,
      "end_ms": 640420,
      "text": "你必须有哲学能力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 640420,
      "end_ms": 643000,
      "text": "对于美的那种什么原始朴素的美"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 643000,
      "end_ms": 646330,
      "text": "进行进一步的符号学和辩证法的进一步的解析"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 646330,
      "end_ms": 647520,
      "text": "进一步的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 649820,
      "end_ms": 651580,
      "text": "综合性的还原啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 651580,
      "end_ms": 652480,
      "text": "我们实事求是讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 652480,
      "end_ms": 653200,
      "text": "如果没有这个能力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 653200,
      "end_ms": 654160,
      "text": "你不要玩美学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 654160,
      "end_ms": 656610,
      "text": "你是个笨蛋低幼的人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 656610,
      "end_ms": 658440,
      "text": "没有资格来讨论这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 658440,
      "end_ms": 660630,
      "text": "所以在美学在哲学当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 660630,
      "end_ms": 664260,
      "text": "它并不具有独立的环节性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 664260,
      "end_ms": 667900,
      "text": "黑格尔的哲学体系基本上取消了这种东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 667900,
      "end_ms": 670900,
      "text": "你如果说你不懂辩证法的人才会玩美学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 670900,
      "end_ms": 671200,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 671200,
      "end_ms": 674600,
      "text": "从事实就是讲不解辩证法的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 674600,
      "end_ms": 676460,
      "text": "或者说当你解了辩证法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 676460,
      "end_ms": 677780,
      "text": "你懂了辩证法之后呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 677780,
      "end_ms": 680780,
      "text": "你的美学并不会停留在这些感性表象上面的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 680780,
      "end_ms": 683600,
      "text": "美学是停留在更更快"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 683600,
      "end_ms": 685940,
      "text": "就是一个个的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 685940,
      "end_ms": 689900,
      "text": "我们说本体论模型不就是高级美学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 689900,
      "end_ms": 691150,
      "text": "会是个什么样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 691150,
      "end_ms": 694450,
      "text": "有些学美学的人高级美学他不是美学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 694450,
      "end_ms": 697570,
      "text": "高级美学是对于哲学"
    },
    {
